{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2020-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1604793600, "end_date": 1605484799, "month_true_total": 1698, "quota": 12, "returned": 12, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:47:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "79331187", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013257399", "personaname": "llMOONll", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198013257399/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 12797, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 699, "last_played": 1712897635, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game many hours to go\n", "timestamp_created": 1605479611, "timestamp_updated": 1605479611, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79326057", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999362601", "personaname": "MORCEGAO-KE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999362601/", "num_games_owned": 3477, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 3538, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3297, "last_played": 1662840531, "avatar": "8896fe2a855fbb58ff1950e505477baefe5744ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Hard, but after you learn how maximize your character, the fun really begins. Don't pay attention for bad reviews, buy it, play it and learn how to damage the enemy. Have fun... :)", "timestamp_created": 1605471899, "timestamp_updated": 1606520651, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79325545", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064300945", "personaname": "x7x.hawk.x7x", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/x7xHawkx7x/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 619, "last_played": 1605487687, "avatar": "035660013bd8780d55d7e401f57276ff9538f46f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really enjoying this game so far!  I'm 53 and it's tough to find games to play with my son.  The cool thing about this game is it's all done in runs.  We go as far as we can, die, and then start over again trying to get further than the last time.  When he's tired of playing with Dad, he just jumps into a run with his buddies.  Really nice persistent perks that can be unlocked to help you advance.  The weapons and scrolls make for some sweet combos.  Very fair price for a game that is not at full release version yet.", "timestamp_created": 1605471203, "timestamp_updated": 1605471203, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79314763", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070756495", "personaname": "JAMES", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/caseformy38/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 626, "last_played": 1726672904, "avatar": "1ebec18549460ccb429638348e4bc7207a194267"}, "language": "english", "review": "yea", "timestamp_created": 1605456968, "timestamp_updated": 1605456968, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483128845691680908", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79314217", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004835228", "personaname": "Screechy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198004835228/", "num_games_owned": 24, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 676, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 215, "last_played": 1606429605, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Addictive and fun with friends !", "timestamp_created": 1605456242, "timestamp_updated": 1605456242, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79310865", "author": {"steamid": "76561198825433200", "personaname": "nubes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198825433200/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 559, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 314, "last_played": 1612241695, "avatar": "fe639691663abb66576bc5ed99ecff8c8296e8fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "Enjoyful roguelite FPS, totally worth it", "timestamp_created": 1605452077, "timestamp_updated": 1605452077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79296880", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134557047", "personaname": "Joey Sparks", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198134557047/", "num_games_owned": 263, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 15021, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 190, "last_played": 1787452165, "avatar": "19662ce140f9f06397bc681c2692f1b69458eeb0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm writing this review at 3 hours in, and I honestly love every bit of this. The design is cute and fun, and the movement is very satisfying. The game is absolutely worth the price right now, and I can't wait to see more of this game as I play it. I overlooked it at first, but I'm glad I finally gave it a shot!\n\nI've seen a dev comment on a review before, so I figure maybe I can add a bit of input as well for them!\nWhile I'd personally love to see more characters, it's completely understandable if you need to wait on that to make sure you get all the bugs fixed. (Though admittedly I haven't seen any yet.)\n\nAll in all though, this game is great, and I can't wait to play more of it!\n\nEDIT: I am now 81 hours in. This game is too fun with friends. Not only have these devs been very consistent with their updates, the new heroes, weapons, and enemies have all been actually great too! If this is on sale, if you want a game with a good bit of replayability, get this. It absolutely is worth your time.\n\nEDIT 2: I am now 116 hours in. The new DLC is amazing! At first, I thought the DLC characters seemed overwhelmingly complex, and hard to learn... but the reality is, they are incredibly fun! I've finally convinced a second friend to try it (and he got addicted almost immediately), so I can finally play with three people! Which I do admit, even without friends to play it with, this game is solid. Even now, this game feels more polished and thought through than many other games I've come to enjoy, which makes me so happy. You can tell that not only are the devs consistent, but they also love what they are doing!", "timestamp_created": 1605431221, "timestamp_updated": 1661912287, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 8, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "79291980", "author": {"steamid": "76561198106917954", "personaname": "Kurt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kurtrusselll/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 32751, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9473, "last_played": 1728537885, "avatar": "c293c28982636383df5d1a086ad95c20011158ac"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mindful Devs\n\nFrequent updates and communication\n\nExtraordinarily fun\n\nWhat else could you ask for at such a low price?\n\n11/10", "timestamp_created": 1605422134, "timestamp_updated": 1605422134, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522058844566345215", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79291913", "author": {"steamid": "76561198309731570", "personaname": "Theo_TG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198309731570/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 215, "last_played": 165658607